{"compatibility":"as-is","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: as-is.

Protected data: `y_aux`, `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

No changes were required. The protected observations are top-level data variables, each is observed exactly once with a plain built-in sampling statement, and the parameters `a` and `b` each have exactly one built-in prior before use.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> N;      // Number of observations
  array[N] real y;           // Observations
  real<lower=0> sigma; // Measurement variability

  int<lower=1> N_aux;      // Number of auxiliary observations
  array[N_aux] real y_aux;       // Auxiliary observations
  real<lower=0> sigma_aux; // Auxiliary measurement variability
}

parameters {
  real a;
  real b;
}

model {
  // Prior model
  a ~ normal(0, 100);
  b ~ normal(0, 100);

  // Auxiliary observational model
  y_aux ~ normal(a, sigma_aux);

  // Observational model
  y ~ normal(a + b, sigma);
}
","data_safe_json":"{
  "N": 3,
  "N_aux": 2,
  "sigma": 4.122133631031135,
  "sigma_aux": 1.9336706402958974,
  "y": [
    3.0,
    3.0,
    3.0
  ],
  "y_aux": [
    2.0,
    2.0
  ]
}","protected_variables":["y_aux","y"]}
